  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;be complex numbers satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup></math>. Then the least value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>, is equal to _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On taking modulus both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>z</mi></menclose></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So comparing both side we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now again from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Now on comaparing imagenary and real part we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Now solving we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then minimum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color:null;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></span></p></blockquote>"
  }
}